#: ../../source/templates_opencode.ai.md:87
msgid "Principles"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/templates_opencode.ai.md:88
msgid ""
"**One font, one voice**: Berkeley Mono is used exclusively. There is no "
"typographic variation between display, body, and code -- everything "
"speaks in the same monospace register. Hierarchy is achieved through size"
" and weight alone."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/templates_opencode.ai.md:89
msgid ""
"**Weight as hierarchy**: 700 for headings, 500 for interactive/medium "
"emphasis, 400 for body text. Three weight levels create the entire "
"hierarchy."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/templates_opencode.ai.md:90
msgid ""
"**Generous line-height**: 1.50 as the standard line-height gives text "
"room to breathe within the monospace grid. The relaxed 2.00 line-height "
"on captions creates clear visual separation."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/templates_opencode.ai.md:91
msgid ""
"**Tight for interaction**: Interactive elements (tabs, compact labels) "
"use 1.00 line-height for dense, clickable targets."
msgstr ""

