#: ../../source/templates_opencode.ai.md:280
msgid ""
"\"Create a hero section on `#201d1d` warm dark background. Headline at "
"38px Berkeley Mono weight 700, line-height 1.50, color `#fdfcfc`. "
"Subtitle at 16px weight 400, color `#9a9898`. Primary CTA button "
"(`#201d1d` bg with `1px solid #646262` border, 4px radius, 4px 20px "
"padding, `#fdfcfc` text at weight 500).\""
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/templates_opencode.ai.md:281
msgid ""
"\"Design a feature list: single-column on `#201d1d` background. Feature "
"name at 16px Berkeley Mono weight 700, color `#fdfcfc`. Description at "
"16px weight 400, color `#9a9898`. No cards, no borders -- pure text with "
"16px vertical gap between items.\""
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/templates_opencode.ai.md:282
msgid ""
"\"Build an email capture form: `#f8f7f7` background input, `1px solid "
"rgba(15, 0, 0, 0.12)` border, 6px radius, 20px padding. Adjacent dark "
"button (`#201d1d` bg, `#fdfcfc` text, 4px radius, 4px 20px padding). "
"Berkeley Mono throughout.\""
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/templates_opencode.ai.md:283
msgid ""
"\"Create navigation: sticky `#201d1d` background. 16px Berkeley Mono "
"weight 500 for links, `#fdfcfc` text. Brand name left-aligned in "
"monospace. Links with underline decoration. No blur, no transparency -- "
"solid dark surface.\""
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/templates_opencode.ai.md:284
msgid ""
"\"Design a footer: `#201d1d` background, multi-column link grid. Links at"
" 16px Berkeley Mono weight 400, color `#9a9898`. Section headers at "
"weight 700. Border-top `1px solid rgba(15, 0, 0, 0.12)` separator.\""
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/templates_opencode.ai.md:286
msgid "Iteration Guide"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/templates_opencode.ai.md:287
msgid ""
"Berkeley Mono is the only font -- never introduce a second typeface. Size"
" and weight create all hierarchy."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/templates_opencode.ai.md:288
msgid ""
"Keep surfaces flat: no shadows, no gradients, no blur effects. Use "
"borders and background shifts only."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/templates_opencode.ai.md:289
msgid ""
"The warm undertone matters: use `#201d1d` not `#000000`, use `#fdfcfc` "
"not `#ffffff`. The reddish warmth is subtle but essential."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/templates_opencode.ai.md:290
msgid ""
"Border radius is 4px everywhere except inputs (6px). Never use rounded "
"pills or large radii."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/templates_opencode.ai.md:291
msgid ""
"Semantic colors follow Apple HIG: `#007aff` blue, `#ff3b30` red, "
"`#30d158` green, `#ff9f0a` orange. Each has hover and active darkened "
"variants."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/templates_opencode.ai.md:292
msgid ""
"Three-stage interaction: default → hover (darkened) → active (deeply "
"darkened) for all semantic colors."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/templates_opencode.ai.md:293
msgid ""
"Borders use `rgba(15, 0, 0, 0.12)` -- a warm transparent dark, not "
"neutral gray. This ties borders to the warm palette."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/templates_opencode.ai.md:294
msgid ""
"Spacing follows an 8px grid: 8, 16, 24, 32, 40, 48, 64, 80, 96px. Use 4px"
" for fine adjustments only."
msgstr ""

